ol gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="99">Here’s a <strong data-start="9" data-end="45">field-theoretic RSVP formulation</strong> for interpreting the Silicon Valley–Hollywood system:</p>
<hr data-start="101" data-end="104">
<h2 data-start="106" data-end="186"><strong data-start="109" data-end="186">RSVP Field-Theoretic Interpretation of Individualist Innovation Economies</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start="188" data-end="212"><strong data-start="192" data-end="212">I. Preliminaries</strong></h3>
<p data-start="213" data-end="329">We treat the cultural economy as an RSVP plenum: a continuous manifold <strong data-start="284" data-end="289">ℳ</strong> equipped with three interacting fields:</p>
