-role="assistant" data-message-id="2b45920d-3ae4-4d4d-876b-bd6675eb12ef" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="313">Got it. Right now your <strong data-start="23" data-end="54">Part III only has Chapter 7</strong> (<em data-start="56" data-end="108">HYDRA and TARTAN: Distributed Modular Intelligence</em>). To really <strong data-start="121" data-end="140">finish Part III</strong>, you can add two or three more chapters that extend the implementation side before moving to a Part IV (which would handle philosophy, governance, and future directions).</p>
<p data-start="315" data-end="343">Here’s a proposed extension:</p>
<hr data-start="345" data-end="348">
<h2 data-start="350" data-end="404"><strong data-start="353" data-end="404">Part III: Implementation and Scaling (extended)</strong></h2>
<p data-start="406" data-end="473"><strong data-start="406" data-end="471">Chapter 7. HYDRA and TARTAN: Distributed Modular Intelligence</strong></p>
<ul data-start="474" data-end="492">
<li data-start="474" data-end="492">
<p data-start="476" data-end="492">Already drafted.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="494" data-end="554"><strong data-start="494" data-end="552">Chapter 8. RSVP Futarchy: Governance as Field Feedback</strong></p>
<ul data-start="555" data-end="1066">
<li data-start="555" data-end="639">
<p data-start="557" data-end="639">Trace roots in <em data-start="572" data-end="588">De Agricultura</em> (Pliny), colonial/patriarchal household regimes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="640" data-end="709">
<p data-start="642" data-end="709">Show how neoliberalism enforces every person as a “founder node.”</p>
</li>
<li data-start="710" data-end="877">
<p data-start="712" data-end="877">Introduce <strong data-start="722" data-end="747">democratized futarchy</strong>: values chosen collectively, beliefs/predictions aggregated through distributed networks (citizen assemblies, expertise pools).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="878" data-end="1066">
<p data-start="880" data-end="923">Formal RSVP equations for policy selection:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant="script">P</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="script">P</mi></munder><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mi mathvariant="script">P</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">V</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mi mathvariant="script">P</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{P}^* = \arg \max_{\mathcal{P}} \langle \Delta \Phi_{\mathcal{P}} \rangle - \alpha \mathrm{Var}(\Delta \Phi_{\mathcal{P}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.7387em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathcal" style="margin-right: 0.08222em;">P</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.7387em;"><span style="top: -3.113em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mbin mtight">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.4943em; vertical-align: -0.7443em;"></span><span class="mop">ar<span style="margin-right: 0.01389em;">g</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mop op-limits"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-