<li data-start="2042" data-end="2317">
<p data-start="2044" data-end="2317">The HYDRA paper explicitly connects this to <strong data-start="2088" data-end="2111">causal traceability</strong> (via CoM) and <strong data-start="2126" data-end="2153">personalized efficiency</strong> (via PERSCEN)  .<br data-start="2170" data-end="2173">
<strong data-start="2173" data-end="2188">Correction:</strong> Add subsections in Appendix H linking each term in <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext>network</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F_{\text{network}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">F</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.1389em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord text mtight"><span class="mord mtight">network</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> to its module origin (PERSCEN, RAT, CoM, RSVP/TARTAN).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2319" data-end="2322">
<h3 data-start="2324" data-end="2365"><strong data-start="2328" data-end="2365">5. Category-Theoretic Integration</strong></h3>
<ul data-start="2366" data-end="2766">
<li data-start="2366" data-end="2471">
<p data-start="2368" data-end="2471">The HYDRA paper formalizes modules as <strong data-start="2406" data-end="2467">functors between topological, graph, and field categories</strong> .</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2472" data-end="2766">
<p data-start="2474" data-end="2484">Example:</p>
<ul data-start="2487" data-end="2766">
<li data-start="2487" data-end="2531">
<p data-start="2489" data-end="2531">RAT: <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext>Top</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>Field</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R: \text{Top} \to \text{Field}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.00773em;">R</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8778em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Top</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Field</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2534" data-end="2584">
<p data-start="2536" data-end="2584">PERSCEN: <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>:</mo><mtext>Cue</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>Graph</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">G_a: \text{Cue} \to \text{Graph}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">G</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">a</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Cue</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Graph</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2587" data-end="2766">
<p data-start="2589" data-end="2766">CoM: <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mtext>Latent</mtext><mi>N</mi></msup><mo>→</mo><mtext>Output</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M: \text{Latent}^N \to \text{Output}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.10903em;">M</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9146em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Latent</span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.9146em;"><span style="top: -3.1362em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.10903em;">N</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8778em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Output</span></span></span></span></span>.<br data-start="2635" data-end="2638">
<strong data-start="2638" data-end="2653">Correction:</strong> Append this categorical mapping to Appendix H.3–H.4, showing how TARTAN functorial coherence ties them together.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2768" data-end="2771">
<h2 data-start="2773" data-end="2786"><strong data-start="2776" data-end="2786">Result</strong></h2>
<p data-start="2787" data-end="3084">If you apply these corrections, your Appendix D/H will reflect that HYDRA is not just an abstract network of RSVP triples but a <strong data-start="2915" data-end="2953">hybridized six-module architecture</strong>, grounded in <strong data-start="2967" data-end="3032">field dynamics, entropy constraints, and categorical mappings</strong>, exactly as described in your formal HYDRA paper.</p>
<hr data-start="3086" data-end="3089">
<p data-start="3091" data-end="3327" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Would you like me to <strong data-start="3112" data-end="3160">rewrite Appendix H in full prose + equations</strong>, weaving in these corrections so you can paste it straight into the monograph? Or would you prefer a <strong data-start="3262" data-end="3286">diff-style edit list</strong> you can apply to your existing appendix?</p></div></div></div></div><div class="relative h-[60px]"><div class="absolute h-[60px]" style="opacity: 1;"><button class="not-prose group/footnote border-token-border-default bg-token-main-surface-primary hover:bg-token-main-surface-secondary mt-3 mb-2 flex w-fit items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl border py-2 ps-3 pe-2.5"><div class="text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-0.5 text-xs font-semibold">Sources</div></button></div></div><div class="flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.66